borghini Miami is delighted to offer this 2015 Lamborghini Hurac&aacute;n LP610-4 for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Powered by a naturally aspirated 5.2L V10 producing an incredible 602 horsepower and 413 lb-ft of torque, the Hurac&aacute;n delivers breathtaking performance with a 0&ndash;60 mph time of approximately 3.2 seconds and a top speed of 202 mph. Its all-wheel-drive system, performance-focused chassis, and sophisticated electronic systems provide exceptional traction, precision, and confidence while allowing the naturally aspirated V10 to deliver its unmistakable soundtrack. The Hurac&aacute;n's low, wide stance, sharp bodywork, distinctive Y-shaped lighting, aggressive air intakes, and dramatic proportions create the unmistakable presence expected from a Lamborghini supercar. Inside, the cockpit surrounds the driver with premium Italian craftsmanship, performance-oriented controls, and advanced technology designed to keep the focus on the driving experience. As the successor to the legendary Gallardo, the Hurac&aacute;n LP610-4 combines everyday usability with exotic-car performance and the character of a naturally aspirated V10. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports \\\/ Lamborghini Miami to make this Hurac&aacute;n LP610-4 yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Coupe\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Coupe\",\"epaHighway\":20,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2015-lamborghini-huracan-lp610-4-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66157191\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2015-Lamborghini-Huracan-LP610-4-North-Miami