Price\":0,\"mileage\":8104,\"transmission\":\"automatic\",\"transmissionDescription\":\"\",\"transmissionSpeedNumber\":\"\",\"engineCylindersNumber\":\"10\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"5.2\",\"engineDescription\":\"\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"Nero Cosmus\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Nero Noctis\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"252627\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147029791,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":69,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-07-23 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"**Unleash Italian Excellence: 2018 Lamborghini Huracan**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is thrilled to present this exceptional 2018 Lamborghini Huracan, a masterpiece of Italian engineering that commands attention wherever it goes. With only 8,104 meticulously maintained miles, this exotic supercar is ready to deliver an unparalleled driving experience.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Performance That Thrills**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this beast lies a naturally aspirated 5.2-liter V10 engine, producing a symphony of power that only a Lamborghini can deliver. Paired with the advanced Lamborghini Doppia Frizione 7-speed dual-clutch transmission featuring sequential shift control and steering wheel-mounted paddles, every gear change is lightning-fast and precise. The full-time all-wheel-drive system ensures maximum traction and control, while the sport-tuned suspension with double wishbone configuration delivers razor-sharp handling dynamics.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Exquisite Interior Craftsmanship**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover the stunning Nero Cosmus interior, featuring premium Unicolor Alcantara seat trim that envelops you in luxury. The full Alcantara simulated suede headliner and carbon fiber accents throughout the cabin create an atmosphere of pure sophistication. Sport bucket seats with electric adjustments provide optimal support during spirited driving, while the dual-zone automatic climate control ensures comfort in any condition.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Track-Ready Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This Huracan comes equipped with driver-selectable modes, allowing you to tailor the driving experience to your preference. The 4-wheel disc brakes with ceramic rotors provide fade-resistant stopping power, while the mechanical limited slip differential maximizes cornering capability. Forged 20-inch Mimas Silver wheels with a distinctive 5-spoke design complete the aggressive stance.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Peace of Mind**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Both CARFAX and AUTOCHECK reports confirm this Huracan's clean history, giving you complete confidence in your investment.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Visit Prestige Imports Today**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Stock #ATA10746 \\\/ VIN: ZHWUS4ZF6JLA10746<br\\\/><br\\\/>Don't miss this rare opportunity to own an icon of automotive excellence. Contact Prestige Imports today to schedule your exclusive test drive and experience the Lamborghini difference. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":19,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2018-lamborghini-huracan-performante-spyder-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65671487\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2018-Lamborghini-Huracan-Performante-Spyder-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZHWUS4ZF6JL