h an 8.4-inch vertical touchscreen featuring Apple CarPlay and Android Auto compatibility, wireless connectivity, and integrated navigation with real-time traffic updates. The advanced LDVI 2.0 system optimizes performance across all driving modes, while the 8-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission delivers lightning-fast shifts.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Hybrid Performance**<br\\\/>The revolutionary plug-in hybrid system combines raw V12 power with electric efficiency, featuring regenerative braking and a 3.8 kWh lithium-ion battery. Full-time all-wheel drive, ceramic brakes, and adaptive suspension ensure this supercar delivers both track-ready performance and surprising everyday usability.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Pristine Provenance**<br\\\/>CARFAX Clean One Owner and AUTOCHECK Clean reports confirm this Revuelto's impeccable history.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock:** ATA01390 \\\/ **VIN:** ZHWUC1ZM6RLA01390<br\\\/><br\\\/>Experience the future of supercars at Prestige Imports today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":17,\"epaCity\":10,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-lamborghini-revuelto---north-miami-beach-fl-id-66036428\",\"mainImageUrl\":null,\"photoCount\":0,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Backup Camera,Hybrid,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Lane Departure Warning,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\