"miscPrice1\":0,\"miscPrice2\":0,\"miscPrice3\":0,\"NADARetailPrice\":0,\"mileage\":2090,\"transmission\":\"automatic\",\"transmissionDescription\":\"\",\"transmissionSpeedNumber\":\"\",\"engineCylindersNumber\":\"12\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"6.5\",\"engineDescription\":\"\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147581281,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":29,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-01 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"**2025 Lamborghini Revuelto &ndash; The Future of Italian Supercar Excellence**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is thrilled to present this extraordinary 2025 Lamborghini Revuelto, representing the pinnacle of hybrid hypercar engineering. With only 2,085 miles on the odometer, this virtually new masterpiece (Stock #ATA01922, VIN: ZHWUC1ZM5SLA01922) comes with both CARFAX Clean One Owner and AUTOCHECK Clean reports, ensuring complete peace of mind.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Groundbreaking Hybrid Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this beast lies a revolutionary 6.5-liter V12 DOHC 48V engine paired with dual front and single rear electric motors, delivering an intoxicating blend of raw power and cutting-edge efficiency through an 8-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission. The full-time all-wheel-drive system with electro-mechanical limited slip differential ensures every ounce of power reaches the pavement with precision. The 3.8 kWh lithium-ion traction battery enables regenerative braking and electric-only driving capabilities, making this the most advanced Lamborghini ever created.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Track-Ready Engineering**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Experience uncompromising control with magnetic fluid-filled shock absorbers, adaptive sport-tuned suspension with driver-selectable ride height, and ceramic disc brakes with 4-wheel ABS. The double wishbone suspension front and rear, combined with front and rear anti-roll bars, delivers razor-sharp handling worthy of the Raging Bull badge.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stunning Design & Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Rolling on exclusive 20-inch front and 21-inch rear Venancio Shiny Silver wheels wrapped in performance run-flat summer tires, this Revuelto commands attention from every angle. The power spoiler, composite\\\/aluminum panels, and aggressive aerodynamics showcase pure Italian artistry.<br\\\/><br\\\/>Inside, luxurious leather seat trim envelops you in comfort, while the 8.4-inch infotainment touchscreen features **Apple CarPlay** and **Android Auto** integration, navigation, and wireless connectivity. The driver-focused cockpit includes carbon fiber instrument panel inserts, simulated suede accents, and a sport leather steering wheel with sequential shift controls.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Safety & Convenience**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Advanced safety features include active lane departure warning, backup camera, dual-stage airbags throughout, electronic stability control, and emergency SOS capability. Proximity key entry with push-button start, dual-zone automatic climate control, and power-folding heated mirrors add everyday usability to this exotic machine.<br\\\/><br\\\/>This is your opportunity to own automotive history. Contact Prestige Imports today to experience the 2025 Lamborghini Revuelto. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":17,\"epaCity\":10,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\